  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the wire is cut into 2 pieces of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Therefore side of square will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and hexagon will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Area of square<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Area of hexagon<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Total&nbsp;area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>On differentiating,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Length of side of regular hexagon<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
